hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18209","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, Muhammad ibn Ishaq informed us, and Ibn Abi Adi from Muhammad ibn Ishaq, Ibn Abi Habib narrated to me, and Yazid said from Ibn Abi Habib from Marthad ibn Abdullah al-Yazani from Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Juhani, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said to us: I am riding tomorrow to the Jews, so do not initiate the greeting with them, and when they greet you say: And upon you."
